//! The `text-emphasis-position` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! sets where emphasis marks are drawn. Similar to the text rendered by the
//! [`<ruby>`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/ruby) HTML
//! element, if there isn't enough room for emphasis marks, the line height is increased.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: [ over | under ] && [ right | left ]?
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-text-decor-4/#propdef-text-emphasis-position
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-emphasis-position
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

